---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>goobusthenoobus</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="../style.css">
    </head>
    <body>
        <main>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="center">
                    <p>
                        <a href="/projects/">Projects</a> · {" "}
                        <a href="/">Posts</a> · {" "}
                        <a href="/about/">This site</a> · {" "}
                        <a href="https://github.com/GoobusTheNoobus/goobusthenoobus.github.io">Repo↗</a>
                    </p>
                    <h1 class="title monospace">Goobus</h1>
                    <p>Always learning. Always coding. <strong>Always larping</strong></p>
                </div>
                <h2>Hello! :D</h2>
                <p>
                    I'm David, and I am a hobbyist programmer, amateur chess engine developer, and YSWS 
                    reviewer who likes building random stuff. I love minimalism (yum) and keep my code 
                    simple and readable.
                </p>
                <h2>About me</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Pronouns: He/Him</li>
                    <li>I prefer understanding my code over blindly copying solutions</li>
                    <li>I am against the use of LLM generated code in my projects, as I 
                        accomplish nothing that way</li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Philippians 4:13</strong> 
                        "I can do all things through him who strengthens me."
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
                <i>
                    I'm still learning, so just because I know something doesn't mean I'm 
                    good at that thing
                </i>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Languages: </strong>
                        C++, Python, HTML/CSS/TypeScript, Java, C#, C and Assembly (A bit)
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Tools: </strong>
                        Git, Github, Linux, VSCode, CLion, PyCharm, Vim/NeoVim, Vite, Astro, Vue
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="posts">
                <h2>Posts</h2>
                <i>Nothing here to see!</i>
            </div>
        </main>
		<Footer></Footer>
        <style>
            main {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
                max-width: 90rem;
                padding: 0 2rem;

                margin: 6rem auto 5rem;
            }

            .content, .posts {
                background-color: #9090900a;
                padding: 2rem 3rem;

                border: var(--color-border) 1px solid;
                border-radius: 10px;
                max-width: 50rem;
            }

            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                main {
                    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
                    padding: 0 1rem;
                    margin-top: 2rem;
                }

                .content, .posts {
                    max-width: none;
                }
            }
            
            .center {
                text-align: center;
                padding-bottom: 1rem;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }

            .center h1 {
                font-size: 5rem;
                letter-spacing: -0.2rem;
                margin-bottom: 0;
            }

            .posts {
                padding-bottom: 4rem;
                min-height: 20rem;
            }

        </style>
    </body>
</html>